    "Покупка подписки обрабатывается Apple. Мы получаем от Apple только факт активной подписки и никогда — платёжные данные." : {
      "comment" : "body",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The subscription purchase is handled by Apple. All we receive from Apple is the fact that a subscription is active — never any payment details."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
