    "Раньше времени отметить нельзя. Так задумано: %@ — это условие из назначения." : {
      "comment" : "waiting",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can't mark it early. That's by design: %@ is a condition from the prescription."
